#: f2db31aa01e047fbb40db667dbdaa121 f8bbdca8c7d44b6e89fde889b9d71a7e
msgid ""
"If you want to support 6 modes then the transmitter will need to emit PWM "
"widths of around 1165, 1295, 1425, 1555, 1685, and 1815 us. Typically this "
"is achieved by configuring the transmitter to mix a two position switch and "
"a three position switch (giving 6 modes in total). You can also do this with"
" an analog dial if one is available, but it’s hard to reliably turn a dial "
"to just the right position for six distinct settings."
msgstr ""
"若需支持 6 个模式，发射机则需输出约 1165、1295、1425、1555、1685 和 1815 us 的 PWM "
"宽度。通常通过将两档开关和三档开关混控来实现（共 6 个模式）。也可使用模拟旋钮（如果有），但很难可靠地将旋钮精确转到六个不同位置。"

